            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Numbered process steps stacked vertically."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "TPP creates a consent via PAR at the API Hub."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The end user is redirected to the LFI to authenticate and authorize the consent."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The TPP exchanges the authorization code for an access token at the API Hub."
